cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "TCGA-THCA miRNA Machine-Learning Analysis"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT

authors:
  - family-names: "Vural"
    given-names: "Duru"
  - family-names: "Köroğlu"
    given-names: "Seyit Metin"
  - family-names: "İzzetoğlu"
    given-names: "Savaş"

abstract: >-
  Computational workflow for TCGA-THCA miRNA expression analysis, including
  data preprocessing, feature selection, class-imbalance handling,
  patient-grouped nested cross-validation, machine-learning model evaluation,
  TOPSIS ranking, feature-stability analysis, and derivation of a 30-miRNA
  candidate biomarker panel for thyroid cancer.
